      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.first().json;\nconst lighthouse = res.lighthouseResult || {};\nconst categories = lighthouse.categories || {};\nconst audits = lighthouse.audits || {};\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      url: res.id || null,\n      performance: categories.performance?.score != null\n        ? Math.round(categories.performance.score * 100)\n        : null,\n      load_time: audits[\"speed-index\"]?.displayValue || null,\n      first_contentful_paint: audits[\"first-contentful-paint\"]?.displayValue || null,\n      total_blocking_time: audits[\"total-blocking-time\"]?.displayValue || null,\n      cumulative_layout_shift: audits[\"cumulative-layout-shift\"]?.displayValue || null,\n      is_mobile_friendly: audits[\"viewport-insight\"]?.score === 1 ? \"Yes\" : \"No\"\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        896,
        0
      ],
      "id": "ee7a1f72-4809-4a00-a7e2-3a3401240ee1",
      "name": "Code in JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a senior website performance consultant working for a digital marketing agency.\n\nYour job is to quickly analyze the provided website performance metrics and generate a short audit message that can be sent to a potential client.\n\nThe tone must be:\n- professional\n- helpful\n- short\n- persuasive\n\nDo NOT produce a long report.\n\nYour goal is to highlight the most important problems and encourage the website owner to fix them with our agency.\n\nReturn the result in this JSON format only:\n\n{\n  \"site_score_summary\": \"\",\n  \"main_issues\": [\n    \"\",\n    \"\",\n    \"\"\n  ],\n  \"recommended_fixes\": [\n    \"\",\n    \"\",\n    \"\"\n  ],\n  \"impact_if_fixed\": \"\",\n  \"agency_cta\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- site_score_summary: exactly 1 sentence\n- site_score_summary MUST include the numeric performance score\n- site_score_summary MUST describe the website condition based on the score\n- site_score_summary MUST NOT include the website URL\n- site_score_summary MUST NOT include markdown, hyperlinks, or domain names\n- main_issues: EXACTLY 3 short bullet points\n- recommended_fixes: EXACTLY 3 short fixes\n- impact_if_fixed: explain business impact in 1 short sentence\n- agency_cta: strong but friendly call to action from a digital marketing agency in 1 short sentence\n\nWebsite audit data:\nURL: {{$json[\"url\"]}}\nPerformance Score: {{$json[\"performance\"]}}\nLoad Time: {{$json[\"load_time\"]}}\nFirst Contentful Paint: {{$json[\"first_contentful_paint\"]}}\nTotal Blocking Time: {{$json[\"total_blocking_time\"]}}\nCumulative Layout Shift: {{$json[\"cumulative_layout_shift\"]}}\nMobile Friendly: {{$json[\"is_mobile_friendly\"]}}\n\nIMPORTANT OUTPUT RULES\n- main_issues MUST contain exactly 3 items.\n- recommended_fixes MUST contain exactly 3 items.\n- If fewer than 3 issues exist, infer additional realistic issues from the metrics.\n- Never return fewer than 3 items.\n- Never return more than 3 items.\n- Each item must be one short sentence.\n- Do not repeat the URL inside any field except where it is already separately provided outside the JSON.\n- site_score_summary must start with: \"Your website performance score is\""
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
